1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,674
The two language marks are awarded for vocabulary, so learn it in groups.

2
00:00:04,674 --> 00:00:07,330
A small rise: it edged up.

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:11,484
A big rise: it rose, climbed, surged, doubled.

4
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:15,468
A big fall: it fell, declined, slumped, plunged.

5
00:00:15,468 --> 00:00:19,713
No change: it remained steady, levelled off, plateaued.

6
00:00:19,713 --> 00:00:21,770
Up and down: it fluctuated.

7
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:25,898
And the turning points: it peaked at, bottomed out at, recovered.

